"Calculate the residual as R = O − C. Calculate the human effect represented by WaterGAP as H = A − C. Calculate the remaining observation–model difference as E = O − A. The equation above shows that R = H + E exactly when the same dates and spatial coverage are used. This accounting separates the modeled human effect from the unexplained difference.",
